<!-- Customer Request #28: matches the new full-screen splash artwork's
     background blue (mobile/assets/splash_full.png / splash_page.dart's
     Scaffold backgroundColor 0xFF0B63D6) instead of plain white, so the
     brief native launch window (before the Flutter engine draws its first
     frame) blends into the Flutter splash rather than flashing white. -->
